# Exclude dev/build clutter from the .vsix. Everything not listed here is
# bundled. The shipped extension needs: extension.js, language-configuration,
# the grammar, icons, snippets, and node_modules (the one runtime dep). It ships
# NO server binary — the .vsix is platform-neutral and the server comes with the
# toolchain (extension.js resolves it). Editor config and source maps are dropped.
.vscode/**
.gitignore
test/**
**/*.map
**/.DS_Store